		<i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χύρρα</span></b> , a call used by
		swineherds, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χυρράβιος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>swine-collar,</i> Id. : but <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χύρραβος</span></b> , ὁ, a
